Statement: "Sending with an idempotency key built from the certificate id, such as certificate-email/cert_7781, would make the provider drop worker c07''s send, because the redelivery comes 30 s later, well inside the 24 h window."', 'single_choice'::question_type, 'True. The key names the side effect ("the certificate email for cert_7781"), so every delivery of the job uses the same key and the provider delivers once and answers the second call as a duplicate. The key must not include the job attempt, the receive count or a timestamp: then every redelivery has a new key and the provider sends again. The limit is the window: after 24 h the provider forgets the key, which is why the worker also writes a marker before sending and does not resend automatically when it finds an old claim.', 2, 5
    WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM challenge.questions WHERE challenge_id = (SELECT id FROM challenge.challenges WHERE public_id = 'chal_quiz_bjm_331') AND order_index = 2)
